SY_TALK("KaxWGDOE1aQ",[[0,["Source Text: http://www.amruta.org/1990/10/21/diwali-puja-1990/"]],[0,["English Transcript Version Date: 2015-1221"]],[16,["It was such a surprise to see you all in that procession."]],[25,["Actually I was waiting and waiting, and I thought,"]],[28,["“Why these people are not coming to call Me for Puja?”"]],[33,["It was a beautiful surprise, it’s very joy giving."]],[57,["The joy was dancing in your eyes."]],[68,["I could see the lights in your eyes"]],[74,["and this is the real Diwali."]],[77,["Diwali word comes from two words: ‘dipa’ and ‘awali’."]],[83,["Dipa means, you know, lights, and awali means rows,"]],[89,["rows and rows of lights."]],[92,["Seems it’s a very, very ancient idea"]],[95,["and all over in the world, you see,"]],[97,["whenever they have to celebrate something"]],[100,["then they put lights. And lights because light gives joy,"]],[108,["gives happiness."]],[112,["So to overcome the darkness of ignorance"]],[117,["also we have to enlighten ourselves."]],[123,["And that is why is important that everybody"]],[127,["should get Self-realization"]],[130,["to feel the light within themselves."]],[135,["And you must have noticed that after realization"]],[139,["the eyes also sparkle."]],[142,["There’s light in the eyes of every Sahaja yogi."]],[150,["Today is the day when we worship the Lakshmi,"]],[157,["Lakshmi principle, which is in our Nabhi."]],[164,["Lakshmi principle that is understood,"]],[167,["I’ve told you many a time, described Lakshmi to you"]],[171,["that She stands on a lotus"]],[176,["and She has two lotuses in Her hands."]],[181,["That means She’s so benevolent, so kind"]],[190,["that She doesn’t pressurize anyone."]],[193,["But normally you don’t find that."]],[196,["Anybody who has money, he’ll just try to pressurize"]],[201,["or try to push down."]],[203,["Even in Sahaja Yoga I’ve seen people like that."]],[206,["If they are little better off, they try to push people,"]],[210,["organize them, to control them"]],[215,["as if they think this is a power they have got"]],[217,["out of the money that they have."]],[220,["But She Herself stands on a lotus"]],[225,["– that means on the beauty. The beauty of Her being"]],[232,["is shown that She doesn’t trouble anyone,"]],[236,["She can stand on a flower."]],[241,["So the first thing, those who have to worship Lakshmi"]],[245,["have to remember one thing"]],[248,["that they are not to pressurize anyone,"]],[252,["to push anyone, to control anyone or destroy."]],[259,["But She with Her feet on the lotuses nourishes the lotus."]],[265,["In Her two hands She has got lotuses."]],[270,["Lotus is a sign of beauty and they being pink, is love."]],[276,["So what does it symbolize?"]],[282,["That a person who has Lakshmi, who has money, who has wealth"]],[287,["should be extremely generous, like a lotus which allows"]],[294,["a horrible gnat-like, black, porky, poking type, little beetle"]],[308,["also to come into it and to sleep."]],[311,["And She provides in the lotus a beautiful bed of comfort"]],[320,["to such a person. He is black, he’s got thorns in it,"]],[325,["but he’s coming to rest, surrendered."]],[329,["And then She covers it with Her petals"]],[334,["and makes it comfortable and protected."]],[339,["So for a person who has money that should be the temperament,"]],[346,["otherwise he loses his money very fast."]],[350,["Or he’s always insecured about his money."]],[353,["He doesn’t know what to do. He wants to put money here,"]],[356,["hide there, hide there, hide there."]],[360,["And there’s no grace about such a person."]],[364,["And the house is such that you never feel comfortable"]],[368,["because all the time they’re worried the carpet will be spoiled,"]],[371,["this will be spoiled, that will be spoiled, that should not be so."]],[374,["What’s the use of having such a house which gives you a headache?"]],[377,["I mean [it’s] common sense!"]],[381,["A house should be such where you can live freely,"]],[383,["at least a house should be like that."]],[386,["But the soon we become materialistic"]],[389,["we get out of our Lakshmi principle."]],[392,["All the beauty of our wealth is finished."]],[397,["I’ve seen people that even a rat doesn’t enter their house,"]],[402,["leave alone human beings."]],[404,["They polish their silver, they polish their brass,"]],[409,["they polish their furniture,"]],[412,["their beautiful house is done with beautiful paper,"]],[419,["expensive things. But a rat also doesn’t enter."]],[425,["And this is what is the Western materialism is:"]],[430,["that we get so much worried about everything."]],[435,["I asked them, “Why are you so much worried?”"]],[437,["They said, “Because it’s an investment"]],[440,["and we have to sell the house.”"]],[442,["Everything is an investment,"]],[444,["they themselves are investments, I think."]],[446,["How will they enjoy?"]],[449,["They cannot enjoy their wealth"]],[450,["because everything seems to be an investment."]],[453,["Their head is an investment, their hair investment,"]],[456,["nose investment, ears investment, everything is an investment!"]],[460,["What’s the use of becoming human beings?"]],[463,["You are just nothing but investments!"]],[466,["Doesn’t matter if the house is little bit sold,"]],[468,["you get little less price. What does it matter?"]],[472,["After all you have lived in that house."]],[475,["But I’ve seen that it’s very common"]],[478,["that if a guest is sitting and the child spills something,"]],[482,["immediately before the guest we’ll start cleaning it."]],[485,["It’s very bad manners."]],[489,["What is this carpet worth than a human being?"]],[493,["So the Lakshmi principle is to understand"]],[497,["that matter is for expression of your love."]],[505,["How much you do for others,"]],[507,["how much comfort you can give to others."]],[510,["I’ve seen some people, I’ve been to some people"]],[514,["that the Gruha Lakshmi, the woman who is in the house,"]],[519,["won’t even look after the tea of the people, nothing!!!"]],[521,["She’s just enjoying herself and bothering about the carpets"]],[527,["or I don’t know, about the soap, about this."]],[530,["I mean so low level it is,"]],[532,["not even, it’s not even a humanistic thing!!!"]],[538,["So, Lakshmi principle means love."]],[542,["This very few people understand."]],[544,["To them Lakshmi means money in the bank. No, doesn’t mean that."]],[552,["It means money or anything like that to express your love."]],[562,["The another symbolic thing about Her is She’s a mother."]],[569,["And mother just gives – nirvajya."]],[572,["She doesn’t charge any interest for what she gives. She just gives."]],[579,["Her enjoyment is giving."]],[583,["I mean I always think what should I cook for you?"]],[586,["If I can do this, I can buy this, I can buy this present for you."]],[590,["I mean Diwali is a good day for Me"]],[592,["that I can give you so many things that I want to give you."]],[596,["And I love it! Nothing like the joy of giving."]],[602,["If you have more things it’s a headache."]],[606,["It’s a headache. But you think that"]],[609,["“I have to buy this thing now. What should I buy for…"]],[613,["oh I have to give it to this one, this will fit that person alright.”"]],[616,["So it relates to the collective feeling,"]],[621,["a very beautiful feeling."]],[627,["So the Western people have to understand"]],[629,["that materialism has gone too far into their heads."]],[636,["Everything to be insured, for what?"]],[644,["But in India if we have such people,"]],[646,["I know one or two people are like that, in a,"]],[649,["say, in a city, small city."]],[652,["Then if they see in the morning these people"]],[654,["they’ll go and have a bath!"]],[658,["Or if they are seeing somebody coming from that side,"]],[661,["of that kind, they’ll just go in the other way round."]],[664,["I asked, “Why is it Baba when that one who is coming…?”"]],[667,["“Is a horrible materialistic fellow! Better go this way!”"]],[670,["But here in the West what should you do?"]],[673,["Everybody is like that! Where should you hide yourself?"]],[682,["So we have to realize, in all introspection we have to realize,"]],[686,["that we have gone too much into materialism."]],[692,["That doesn’t mean that you should not make money!"]],[696,["That doesn’t mean you should not work,"]],[698,["you should be lethargic, that you should say that"]],[701,["“Oh, Mother has said. Now, let us be lotus eaters.'”"]],[705,["Not that. Try to understand!"]],[708,["If you are making money it is just to give."]],[716,["Then otherwise your situation will be bad,"]],[718,["you’ll be always insecured about money."]],[720,["And those who have money instead of feeling secured"]],[723,["they are the all day shaking like this, I have seen."]],[728,["So what is the use of having?"]],[729,["Is better not to have anything like that that shakes you."]],[732,["Better to settle down with a little hut somewhere"]],[735,["and enjoy Sahaja Yoga!"]],[741,["So Lakshmi tattwa is not money-oriented."]],[746,["Supposing you take a dog or take a donkey"]],[751,["and put lots of notes on that, will you call him a lakshmipati?"]],[761,["Or take another human being who has got ten cars to show off,"]],[766,["who has got a swanky car,"]],[769,["and who is nervous, twitchy."]],[771,["Will you call him a lakshmipati?"]],[776,["There is no grace in this kind of money that people have."]],[785,["They are crazy, they have no traditions,"]],[788,["they have no sweetness, nothing in them."]],[792,["They are dry, as if the whole juice has been"]],[797,["taken out of the sugar cane, they are like that."]],[801,["And nobody wants to go to such houses."]],[804,["But to be very frank in such houses if I eat, I get vomiting."]],[811,["My Lakshmi doesn’t like it."]],[816,["So you should feel obliged that you can give to others."]],[819,["You should feel obliged that you can do for others."]],[822,["This is the first sign of a Sahaja yogi."]],[829,["I shouldn’t say but, what I’ve heard from many people"]],[832,["that people don’t like to spend any money for Sahaja Yoga."]],[836,["They’ll spend for anything else."]],[838,["They’ll take some, what you call, the face,"]],[841,["what you call them? Cosmetics."]],[844,["Or men may buy something expensive, watches, some things."]],[848,["But for Sahaja Yoga they don’t want to spend."]],[850,["Now you have to know that Sahaja Yoga is"]],[854,["for the emancipation of the whole world."]],[862,["What is this cosmetic going to do for the whole world?"]],[866,["Or your watch, what is it going to do?"]],[873,["Or the way you dress up or the way you try to show off,"]],[878,["is it going to help the world?"]],[880,["You are here to help the world and not to decorate yourself"]],[886,["and just to make advantage of Sahaja Yoga!"]],[891,["So it’s very blissful. Sahaja Yoga is extremely blissful."]],[896,["It gives you first the glimpse of Lakshmi"]],[899,["that it gives you money. You are blessed."]],[904,["And then that is the first temptation"]],[914,["and you fall a prey, and you go down."]],[923,["So this Lakshmi principle is to be understood in its proper way."]],[930,["For Sahaja yogis is very important"]],[932,["because it is not so superficial as we think."]],[936,["It is much deeper within us and when we touch our depth,"]],[942,["it shows."]],[948,["Then there are two other symbols we see."]],[953,["With left hand She gives."]],[960,["I’ve given this simile many a times that, if you open one door"]],[963,["the air won’t come in."]],[965,["You have to open the other one so it circulates."]],[967,["She must give."]],[970,["So all those who have Lakshmi tattwa developed in them,"]],[976,["they think what to give."]],[979,["But they don’t give the worst thing that they have."]],[983,["Just like a waste paper basket is a friend,"]],[986,["“Ah! This is useless. I better,"]],[988,["instead of throwing, I can give it to that friend.”"]],[991,["And then friend says, “All right."]],[993,["It’s very nice. I’ll give it to another friend.”"]],[997,["And all friends are used as waste paper baskets."]],[1001,["Whatever is the worst is given."]],[1007,["How can you touch your depth?"]],[1011,["Whatever is the best if you can give,"]],[1016,["if you are free to give, you should give the best."]],[1025,["So, one of the snags is that"]],[1028,["we have never learnt the art of giving."]],[1032,["If we learn the art of giving then it’s so joyous, so beautiful."]],[1041,["Because we are very ego-oriented,"]],[1045,["we understand what gives us joy"]],[1047,["but we don’t understand what will give joy to others."]],[1050,["And when we understand what will give joy to others,"]],[1054,["then that joy reflects on us much more, thousand times."]],[1065,["But there is then, as I said,"]],[1068,["that on the periphery both things work out."]],[1070,["From one side are the miserly,"]],[1073,["from the other side are the exploiters."]],[1078,["So if you become generous, the exploiters are there."]],[1084,["So then an antithesis, another type of people become,"]],[1090,["who get nervous, who don’t know what to do, where to go."]],[1095,["In Sahaja Yoga you do trust people, all the time."]],[1102,["You give. Of course sometimes you are exploited."]],[1107,["So doesn’t matter, that’s not your look out."]],[1109,["You have not committed any sin."]],[1111,["The one who has exploited you, he has committed the sin"]],[1114,["and he is going to suffer, so why should you worry?"]],[1120,["But with the help of this divine power,"]],[1124,["the one who exploits will suffer."]],[1129,["And you will get ten times more than what you have lost."]],[1134,["This is what it is to be understood by Sahaja yogis."]],[1137,["That we are now blessed by this divine power."]],[1142,["We are not alone. All the time it is blessing us."]],[1152,["So giving means nothing is mine."]],[1156,["“My, my, my, my,” has to be given up."]],[1161,["Even in Sahaja Yoga I was surprised"]],[1164,["that people in the West who were not attached to their children"]],[1167,["get very much attached to their children."]],[1170,["And they just think about their children and nothing else."]],[1175,["This is another kind of selfishness."]],[1183,["If you just think of your own children only and nobody else,"]],[1187,["then the same children will become devils"]],[1191,["and teach you a lesson."]],[1194,["And you’ll say, “Next time, oh God, don’t give me any children,"]],[1198,["had enough!” But if you make the child collective"]],[1205,["and teach child to give others and to enjoy that,"]],[1209,["then from the very childhood the child becomes"]],[1212,["extremely generous."]],[1219,["I mean generosity is the quality,"]],[1224,["is of an incarnation – aishwarya."]],[1228,["Aishwarya doesn’t mean only the money, the wealth,"]],[1232,["but generosity excels the money."]],[1241,["That is aishwarya, and that is the sign"]],[1244,["of an incarnation and sign of a Sahaja yogi."]],[1253,["The another hand is like this."]],[1257,["That means She gives you protection."]],[1263,["If you don’t feel protected with money, throw it away."]],[1266,["Just run away from it. Headache."]],[1272,["But also She gives protection to others."]],[1275,["A person who has Lakshmi, he has family,"]],[1278,["he has children, he has everyone."]],[1285,["The worst thing I’ve seen [is]"]],[1287,["that in the West"]],[1288,["the parents don’t give any money to their children"]],[1292,["when they grow up. Then don’t look after them"]],[1296,["but they are so possessive!"]],[1300,["On the contrary, in India"]],[1303,["we give all our lives to our children and we are least possessive."]],[1307,["And they are even possessive of the grandchildren."]],[1310,["That’s why the families are like this here."]],[1313,["So the whole system has gone in a funny way, chaotic."]],[1319,["So it is important for Sahaja yogis to understand"]],[1322,["that they will first of all look after their children,"]],[1329,["give them whatever they need, nourish them,"]],[1331,["give them guidance, don’t spoil them."]],[1335,["And, secondly, once they are married and have children"]],[1341,["they will not try to possess them"]],[1343,["and possess their children, their wives."]],[1350,["And this protection that is given"]],[1353,["is the protection of a mother."]],[1357,["Say you are working in an office,"]],[1359,["you’re working in a hospital,"]],[1362,["you’re working in a factory, anywhere you are working,"]],[1365,["all other people who are working under you"]],[1368,["are your children, are to be treated like that"]],[1371,["and they are to feel like that."]],[1373,["They have to feel it’s a family. Try this!"]],[1378,["My husband, I told him that,"]],[1380,["“You treat your office as your family.”"]],[1384,["So early in the morning they used to arrive from Calcutta,"]],[1387,["about say five o’clock, by plane."]],[1391,["And I would Myself cook their breakfast and give it to them."]],[1395,["They were just ordinary clerks."]],[1400,["Because this is how through the protection,"]],[1404,["through the care, through the love"]],[1407,["you can make them so dynamic"]],[1411,["and that is how the Lakshmi tattwa will increase."]],[1413,["Otherwise there will be strikes, there will be fights."]],[1416,["This is the enlightenment!"]],[1423,["That’s why a person who thinks he is capitalistic"]],[1426,["must understand that the capital is worth nothing"]],[1430,["if you don’t know how to use your Lakshmi principle."]],[1434,["That’s why they end up in jail, they end up in lunatic asylums"]],[1437,["or they become smugglers or something happens to them."]],[1441,["They just go off. They are never respectable."]],[1446,["And I haven’t seen any statue of a man"]],[1449,["who has been garlanded for being rich!"]],[1458,["So if you are rich, nobody is going to respect you."]],[1463,["But for generosity, something substantial, what you have done."]],[1470,["Something substantial – for others, for the society,"]],[1478,["for Sahaja Yoga."]],[1483,["We are working out now ashrams"]],[1486,["and projects and things and all that"]],[1489,["but when it comes to money, Sahaja yogis think,"]],[1492,["“Oh no, that’s not my job. Only I can send my child there."]],[1496,["Mother must look after all the children,"]],[1498,["Mother must do this, Mother must find out this,"]],[1500,["She must provide for this.” Everything She should do"]],[1503,["and what about me?"]],[1505,["I’ll just put money in the banks, Swiss banks specially.”"]],[1514,["So one has to decide, “How much of my money I am giving"]],[1520,["for the work of Sahaja Yoga?” I don’t want your money."]],[1523,["No money is to be given for Sahaja Yoga, in the sense,"]],[1525,["for your realization. But if you have to have a hall,"]],[1529,["if you have to have a program,"]],[1530,["if you have to have an ashram,"]],[1532,["anything is to be done, you need money."]],[1534,["And for that anybody asks, “All right give one pound each”"]],[1537,["They won’t give. “No, why should I give one pound?”"]],[1545,["And there’s a national competition in that,"]],[1549,["national competition."]],[1555,["It shows that still you have not touched your depth."]],[1558,["If you touch your depth, you’ll give"]],[1562,["and you’ll enjoy your giving. You must touch your depths."]],[1566,["So the enlightenment is yet not complete."]],[1570,["Now, I’m saying it to you all individually,"]],[1574,["you introspect yourself and see for yourself."]],[1581,["Let us see, count how much money"]],[1583,["have I given for Sahaja Yoga work,"]],[1587,["all of us, individually."]],[1594,["Now, you will give Me present,"]],[1596,["because you think that gives you blessings."]],[1598,["That’s not the point. Point is –"]],[1600,["“How much money I have kept for Sahaja Yoga out of my income?”"]],[1611,["This is the first question of Lakshmi principle."]],[1617,["Now, how the Mahalakshmi tattwa comes in?"]],[1620,["First the Lakshmi. Lakshmi is born out of the sea."]],[1626,["Now, why She was born out of the sea?"]],[1635,["She was born out of the sea because Her father"]],[1639,["is a generous personality. Look at the sea."]],[1646,["It spreads its wings all over,"]],[1649,["gets itself heated up completely so that clouds are made."]],[1657,["And these clouds go and bang at those high mountains"]],[1666,["where it rains."]],[1668,["They form the rivers and then they come back to the sea."]],[1673,["But all this, while the sea contains"]],[1675,["all the salt within itself, all the salt is within itself."]],[1682,["And then it gives salt. Christ has said, “You are the salt.”"]],[1688,["What is the salt? Salt, which gives the taste to food,"]],[1695,["is your Guru principle."]],[1698,["You cannot become a Guru, you cannot become a leader,"]],[1702,["if you are a miserly person. You cannot."]],[1704,["How horrible even it looks, just imagine!"]],[1710,["So She is born out of the Guru principle."]],[1716,["And this Guru principle starts working in you,"]],[1721,["when you have this Lakshmi principle awakened."]],[1726,["Not money, I’m not saying money. Is the Lakshmi principle"]],[1731,["when you start thinking,"]],[1733,["“What sweet thing I should give to another?”"]],[1741,["When you start thinking, “What should I do for others?”"]],[1748,["You have to be extremely sweet, soft, not dry, not dry people."]],[1761,["“How to express my love?”"]],[1766,["So first thing is, as the sea spreads its wings"]],[1770,["and says, “All right, let the sun take away my water,"]],[1776,["let me boil, let it become the clouds.”"]],[1785,["In the same way you people have to understand"]],[1790,["that unless and until I allow the Sun, that’s the Spirit,"]],[1798,["to evaporate this water from me, means to give to others,"]],[1806,["how will I develop this guru principle within myself?"]],[1810,["You cannot have salt in the seawater"]],[1813,["unless and until you evaporate it."]],[1817,["So you cannot become a guru unless and until you allow"]],[1821,["the evaporation of this water,"]],[1824,["of this wealth, the money that you have."]],[1834,["But if you are not matured enough, like the sea,"]],[1843,["then you will remain at a level that, like mad,"]],[1853,["collecting all the muck of the world"]],[1856,["and ultimately end up in some lunatic asylum."]],[1862,["Because all maryadas are lost, all dharma is lost."]],[1866,["Without guru principle, how you can have dharma?"]],[1870,["You do not think of anybody else,"]],[1872,["you do not even think of your father, mother or anyone,"]],[1874,["you don’t think of your collective work,"]],[1876,["you don’t think of the world. That’s too much."]],[1881,["So you become small, small, small, small, small."]],[1888,["But when this Lakshmi tattwa starts,"]],[1891,["that’s the first inkling of love, love for others."]],[1900,["I know you all love Me very much."]],[1903,["But it’s not complete reflection of your Mother."]],[1908,["You have to love each other"]],[1912,["and share everything with each other, with love."]],[1922,["Then this first light of love, Lakshmi, starts showing in you."]],[1930,["In that light when you move, you become very deeply generous,"]],[1939,["enjoy your generosity."]],[1943,["But I’ve seen"]],[1946,["before Sahaja Yoga people don’t care for their children,"]],[1949,["don’t care for their wives, don’t care for anything."]],[1952,["Either they go to the pubs or they have other women kept"]],[1956,["or something like that. But after Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1961,["like a pendulum, they move to the other extreme."]],[1966,["Then their wife is the most important."]],[1969,["Even if she’s a bhoot, anything, she’s the most important thing."]],[1973,["Then the children. Like hawks, they grab their children,"]],[1980,["their wife, their house, their things."]],[1985,["To them then becomes, “This is the main duty."]],[1987,["Mother has said we should have good families.”"]],[1990,["But I didn’t say that you become slaves of your families."]],[1995,["I don’t say you break your families,"]],[1999,["but don’t crush them with your narrowness."]],[2003,["Let them grow, let them open out."]],[2012,["So from one extreme to another extreme you move."]],[2016,["You have to come in the center."]],[2021,["So this love has to start showing itself,"]],[2025,["manifesting itself in all humility."]],[2029,["You are doing it for yourself, you are not doing it for others."]],[2033,["If I’m trying to help somebody with money,"]],[2036,["I’m trying to help Myself"]],[2038,["because I can’t bear that person in trouble,"]],[2042,["so, no obligation."]],[2048,["And I do it secretly."]],[2051,["I don’t want to talk about it"]],[2052,["because I’m enjoying it secretly, I’m enjoying Myself."]],[2057,["I’m not enjoying the idea that I’m doing this for others"]],[2067,["but just for Myself."]],[2076,["So the ego part that is within us,"]],[2082,["which is more bloated with money."]],[2088,["I mean, you can take out a man who has money."]],[2091,["They’ll stand off from others. They’re different, you know."]],[2099,["Then you think, “Is he coming from lunatic asylum?”"]],[2102,["“No, no, no, no, he is very rich.”"]],[2105,["They look as if they are from lunatic asylum,"]],[2108,["but they are “No, no, no! They are rich, rich people, very rich!”"]],[2112,["They stand in a wing, angular way,"]],[2115,["look at others in an angular way, very stupid people."]],[2124,["So this is what we have to understand,"]],[2127,["that we have come out of one kind of nonsense,"]],[2129,["we should not jump into another."]],[2135,["And we should see that we are here for Sahaja Yoga."]],[2139,["We are specially chosen for Sahaja Yoga."]],[2142,["We have to work out Sahaja Yoga and nothing else."]],[2145,["All our family, all our household,"]],[2147,["everything, everything is nothing but Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2151,["because we are dedicated, that we are deeply into it."]],[2159,["So all these questions I find – women dominating men,"]],[2162,["men dominating women – will all disappear"]],[2165,["the moment you decide"]],[2166,["that we have to awaken Mahalakshmi principle within us."]],[2170,["And the Mahalakshmi principle is the principle"]],[2173,["where you start seeking the truth and nothing else."]],[2178,["But how can you seek the truth without any light in your hand?"]],[2189,["It’s not some sort of an abstract thing or just a drama."]],[2195,["“Oh, I’m seeking the truth with my eyes closed"]],[2200,["and with darkness in my hand, I’m seeking the truth!”"]],[2206,["How can you take to Mahalakshmi principle"]],[2209,["unless and until the Lakshmi principle is embedded in you?"]],[2213,["Unless and until you feel that love for each other,"]],[2217,["you have felt that love, you have expressed that love,"]],[2219,["you have been generous,"]],[2221,["you have been enjoying the generosity of your own."]],[2225,["Then only you can rise up to that principle of Mahalakshmi"]],[2231,["which is the spiritual principle."]],[2238,["And this spiritual principle has been established within us"]],[2243,["by penances of all the deities, if you see."]],[2251,["See, look at Sita."]],[2254,["She was born a daughter of a great king,"]],[2259,["married in a family who was so rich."]],[2264,["And She had to go in the jungles without even shoes"]],[2270,["and She had to starve Herself for our sake."]],[2277,["And then with all these She suffered,"]],[2283,["without any comfort She lived"]],[2286,["and then was attacked by this horrible Ravana."]],[2291,["She lived with him and kept Her chastity and purity"]],[2296,["and then She came out of that ordeal"]],[2300,["and She created this Mahalakshmi principle to begin with."]],[2306,["Why did She do it?"]],[2312,["She should have succumbed to this Ravana and should have enjoyed."]],[2315,["I mean, normally people would do that."]],[2318,["Why did She suffer so much?"]],[2322,["Because She had a nobler life to lead to, for our sake."]],[2330,["She had to do that ordeal for our sake."]],[2336,["And She did it."]],[2340,["So She was the first incarnation,"]],[2343,["we can say, of Mahalakshmi principle."]],[2348,["You see Her background and from where to what She went."]],[2358,["Sakshat Mahalakshmi had to go through all these things"]],[2363,["to show us that if you want"]],[2367,["to have the Mahalakshmi principle within you"]],[2370,["then what sort of a woman you should be."]],[2376,["That’s the first we have seen Her in anything."]],[2380,["Then who came afterwards than Her, is Radha."]],[2387,["Radha came, Ra-dha. ‘Ra’ is energy,"]],[2390,["‘dha’ is the one who has sustained, is Radha."]],[2397,["If you see Her life,"]],[2400,["all Her life She worked out our Kundalini – Raasa."]],[2411,["Full of sweetness, full of beautiful generosity,"]],[2421,["She danced and danced and danced."]],[2425,["Her feet used to pain when Shri Krishna used to rub them."]],[2433,["And She didn’t go with Shri Krishna."]],[2436,["When He became the king She said, “You go, that’s all right."]],[2440,["I’m not [going]."]],[2442,["I have to still work out Mahalakshmi principle"]],[2445,["among the gopas and gopis.”"]],[2448,["She stayed back in a small place."]],[2453,["But how much surrendered She was to Shri Krishna,"]],[2460,["how much surrendered She was to the work of Virata."]],[2466,["That She knew, “I have to work out the Virata’s work.”"]],[2470,["And She stayed back."]],[2473,["There are so many beautiful stories about Her."]],[2478,["So this second penance of the Mahalakshmi we know in Radha."]],[2491,["Then the third one came as the Mother of Christ."]],[2497,["She gave Her child to be crucified."]],[2503,["Will we just introspect ourselves!"]],[2508,["How much we are attached like hawks on our children."]],[2514,["If anybody says anything to the children, people don’t like it."]],[2520,["I’ve got reports from Switzerland"]],[2523,["that if anybody says anything to the children,"]],[2525,["the parents don’t like it. No."]],[2534,["Nobody should say anything to their children."]],[2540,["Here She gives Her child"]],[2544,["to be crucified for the emancipation of humanity."]],[2552,["I can’t even look at the cross."]],[2560,["While we are so much attached to our children,"]],[2565,["what are we teaching them? Are we teaching them any sacrifices?"]],[2571,["Are we teaching them any sharing?"]],[2574,["Are we teaching them any tolerance?"]],[2577,["Are we teaching them forgiveness?"]],[2583,["On the contrary, if anybody says anything to the child"]],[2586,["we don’t like it, leave alone crucifixion,"]],[2590,["leave alone even little punishment."]],[2593,["The child has now become the biggest ordeal for Sahaja yogis."]],[2598,["I can tell you, I can see it so clearly."]],[2602,["The attachment to children is so great in the West"]],[2606,["that I am surprised."]],[2610,["Everybody gets children, what’s so great about it?"]],[2614,["The greatness is what kind of children you are."]],[2617,["Tomorrow these children ……"]],[2618,["Please move the child that side. Don’t do that. Get out!"]],[2622,["Please get out and don’t do that in the lectures."]],[2624,["I don’t like women standing here and moving their carts"]],[2628,["and this… Show some respect! Can you do that in a church?"]],[2635,["You see sometimes I do not understand"]],[2638,["that a certain protocol also women don’t understand."]],[2642,["Please take child out"]],[2643,["and don’t keep the thing here, go out! Please tell her."]],[2652,["You don’t take your perambulators in the churches do you,"]],[2656,["where there is no Adi Shakti sitting?"]],[2662,["Because the principle is mainly your own child,"]],[2666,["it’s grabbing you, I tell you, it’s grabbing you."]],[2670,["Your children are grabbing you and you are grabbing them."]],[2674,["So we must understand."]],[2677,["Are we allowing our children to grow big?"]],[2681,["Are they generous? Are they saints?"]],[2688,["Are they beautiful?"]],[2692,["How do they talk to others? Are they confident?"]],[2695,["Tomorrow they are going to be the leaders of Sahaja yogis."]],[2702,["Like Shivaji’s mother, like Jijamata,"]],[2706,["how she made the son great!"]],[2710,["It’s the mother who makes the children great,"]],[2713,["and if she wants all the time to sort of a, grab the child"]],[2720,["and the child to grab the mother, then it is suicidal,"]],[2725,["suicidal for you and suicidal for the children."]],[2731,["What have we done about our children?"]],[2738,["Is duty of every Sahaja yogi to see that their children grow,"]],[2742,["grow as great people, greater than you."]],[2749,["They have to look after the world."]],[2754,["If you spend time with your children, see that"]],[2758,["you mould them, you nourish them with love"]],[2760,["and tell them that they should give love to others."]],[2765,["That they should behave in such a manner"]],[2768,["that everybody should feel that love through them."]],[2772,["Otherwise they will become devils like Ravana."]],[2780,["Ravana was a realized soul and spoilt by his mother,"]],[2783,["became a devil."]],[2789,["If you don’t want your children to be devils,"]],[2792,["first of all understand that they are not your children,"]],[2794,["they are My children, under your trust."]],[2798,["And you are not to make your children dwarfish and smalls."]],[2806,["This is a new temptation I find in Sahaja Yoga"]],[2811,["people are developing, so be careful."]],[2814,["I wanted to warn you"]],[2816,["because we have to make our children like lights."]],[2819,["Light burns for others, not for itself."]],[2825,["We talk of lights, Diwali, all right, but"]],[2828,["these lights are burning for others every moment."]],[2833,["Do we learn from them? Are we burning for others?"]],[2837,["Are our children going to burn for the others?"]],[2840,["You are making them so selfish."]],[2846,["So thousands and thousands of children are going to come."]],[2850,["And even when they are born realized, I’ve seen you spoil them."]],[2855,["I mean, if you take a diamond and put it in a gutter"]],[2859,["it will be lost. It’s like that."]],[2862,["Even if you have the best children, you can ruin them"]],[2865,["by this kind of stupid idea that,"]],[2867,["“That’s my child, this is mine.”"]],[2873,["Expose your children to good things."]],[2876,["Tell them what is good. Tell them how to be good to others,"]],[2880,["tell them to look after them,"]],[2882,["tell them how to press the feet of others,"]],[2884,["how to comb the hair, how to give food to others."]],[2888,["Teach them! Let them carry little trays and feed others,"]],[2895,["to the birds, let them give water to the flowers."]],[2902,["Don’t make them small."]],[2906,["Some of the children are really dynamic,"]],[2909,["great saints born to you, but you are ruining them"]],[2912,["and I have to warn you about it that,"]],[2914,["in Mahalakshmi tattwa, if you have to now give it to them,"]],[2917,["please remember that all these great incarnations of Mahalakshmi"]],[2922,["had to go through such ordeal."]],[2924,["So what is the incarnation of Mary teaches us?"]],[2927,["Many people say, “Oh what was Mary? After all,"]],[2929,["She was just nothing.” Look at the incarnation of Mary."]],[2933,["What does She teach us? You are supposed to be Christians."]],[2942,["You are supposed to be Hindus. Supposed."]],[2947,["But what do they teach us these Mahalakshmi principles?"]],[2951,["The last Mahalakshmi principle came as Fatima."]],[2959,["Fatima, the Gruha Lakshmi, She stayed at home."]],[2964,["She didn’t show off. She was not the one who went out."]],[2969,["She stayed at home, looked after household,"]],[2971,["looked after their children and made them two great warriors."]],[2975,["Her children and Her husband, they fought for the right,"]],[2979,["they fought for the truth."]],[2987,["She was a Gruha Lakshmi."]],[2989,["I’ve seen, I’m sometimes very much amazed also,"]],[2993,["that if you see the television, [when] a child is lost"]],[2998,["is the mother who speaks, the father does not."]],[3001,["He seems more shocked than the mother."]],[3005,["Mother is trying to show off"]],[3006,["because she thinks in the television she will be seen."]],[3009,["She’s forgotten her pain, she’s forgotten everything."]],[3011,["She is the one who is speaking, the father is quiet."]],[3014,["He’s much more shocked than the mother."]],[3016,["Is a common thing you see. Normally a mother should be shocked."]],[3026,["So what is the principle of Mahalakshmi?"]],[3030,["Is that first is of sacrifice."]],[3036,["Sacrifice their own children on the altar of truth."]],[3046,["Of course that is not needed in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3050,["You are all blessed people,"]],[3051,["you don’t have to sacrifice anything whatsoever."]],[3054,["But if you do not develop your children into proper ways,"]],[3063,["they will hold you responsible"]],[3070,["and they will say, “Why did you not give us a full scope to develop?”"]],[3081,["If you find your child is obstinate,"]],[3085,["if you find your child is miserly,"]],[3090,["if you find your child he doesn’t know how to share love with others"]],[3094,["or dominating, try to curb it down immediately."]],[3098,["Children are very clever, extremely clever."]],[3102,["The moment they realize that they will lose your love,"]],[3106,["they behave themselves."]],[3112,["So this Mahalakshmi principle has to grow among men,"]],[3116,["as well as in women. We have families now"]],[3120,["and this has to work out, that,"]],[3122,["do the whole family people sit down and meditate?"]],[3129,["Do we teach our children the proper protocol of Shri Mataji?"]],[3136,["Like a lady bringing a perambulator in the hall – is absurd!"]],[3140,["I mean, can you bring a perambulator in the church?"]],[3151,["This is more than a church."]],[3152,["Do you realize whom are you facing?"]],[3161,["And this is what you have to tell your children"]],[3164,["because this is the greatest time."]],[3168,["This is the greatest time when you are here,"]],[3170,["the greatest time of spirituality,"]],[3173,["of the complete manifestation of the powers of the Goddess,"]],[3178,["where your children have to be the real flowers of beauty."]],[3184,["Please don’t try to cover them up with their souls dying out there"]],[3193,["under the cover of so-called love for them."]],[3198,["So we have now three principles of Mahalakshmi that we have seen."]],[3202,["And the fourth one is Myself."]],[3210,["Mine is a much deeper work,"]],[3217,["much wider and tremendous patience is needed."]],[3224,["It won’t work out if I sacrifice anyone."]],[3229,["I have to sacrifice Myself."]],[3233,["I have to sacrifice My family, so-called."]],[3237,["I have to sacrifice My sleep,"]],[3241,["sacrifice comforts, everything possible under the sun."]],[3246,["I have to sacrifice for one reason"]],[3249,["that, your Mahalakshmi tattwa should be manifested."]],[3253,["It should have its fruits."]],[3257,["So you came to Sahaja Yoga as the seekers of truth,"]],[3261,["blessed by Mahalakshmi principle already"]],[3266,["and if that is so, let us feel it."]],[3272,["We love our Mother. Why? Why do we love?"]],[3274,["Why do we love Her? Because She loves us."]],[3278,["But love doesn’t mean without any effort,"]],[3287,["without any work, without any sacrifice."]],[3292,["I don’t feel the sacrifice."]],[3295,["I don’t feel at all anything like that."]],[3300,["Outwardly many people say, “Mother, how much You are traveling!"]],[3304,["Mother, how much You are doing this!” I don’t feel that"]],[3308,["because I enjoy it."]],[3313,["And that is what it is important."]],[3316,["If we have to develop our full personality,"]],[3321,["we have to know that our love should not be only a lip service."]],[3330,["We have to work."]],[3333,["I’ve seen people when it comes to working for Sahaja Yoga,"]],[3338,["they just run away. Where are they?"]],[3341,["Nobody is available, all are out."]],[3343,["Only five, six people are working. And where the rest are?"]],[3347,["“Oh, they’ll only come Mother when You will come.”"]],[3356,["What work have you put in? What effort we have put in?"]],[3362,["We, just we are enjoying ourselves, all right."]],[3366,["But enjoyment without any effort,"]],[3369,["enjoyment without any sacrifice cannot be complete."]],[3378,["If you are attached to your comfort, to your laziness,"]],[3381,["to your selfishness and all that,"]],[3383,["of course that will be there, but you cannot enjoy."]],[3388,["You cannot enjoy."]],[3390,["You’ll only enjoy when you just care for enjoyment"]],[3394,["and the rest of it is finished."]],[3398,["Now before you is your Mother."]],[3404,["I’ve seen yesterday people were sleepy."]],[3406,["Today also there are many who are sleepy, sitting here,"]],[3410,["can’t open their eyes."]],[3415,["Why? Because they’re not yet in it."]],[3424,["But for Me, I can keep awake for three nights,"]],[3427,["ten nights, twelve nights,"]],[3430,["and I can sleep for one hour or for one year, if I want."]],[3437,["Because everything is under command. Why is it in command?"]],[3442,["Because I love. This is the power of love."]],[3447,["The power of love gives you complete command over everything,"]],[3453,["over your body, your mind, over your ego, over everything."]],[3461,["Complete command, power of love."]],[3464,["Now I went to Greece"]],[3470,["and you know what things I brought from there."]],[3472,["And then we went into this shop to buy some things"]],[3475,["for your Diwali Puja. But they were so expensive!"]],[3479,["I said, “No, no, no, no, it’s too much, too much.”"]],[3483,["But they’ll buy something."]],[3486,["We found out that, that was sold in here in Italy."]],[3492,["But can you believe that is sold in Padova?"]],[3496,["When you are having your puja here,"]],[3501,["the presents are sold here at a very cheap price, ten times less!"]],[3506,["Now who has arranged all this? This power of love."]],[3512,["If you love someone without any expectations,"]],[3520,["then this power of love just floods you with things,"]],[3526,["with ideas, with everything."]],[3530,["But just try to understand. It should be pure love,"]],[3536,["without thinking, pure love,"]],[3541,["just a feeling that I’m enjoying it, anything."]],[3552,["The whole day I went there and Hamir was quite upset"]],[3557,["that Mother, poor thing, had to be without food, had to do."]],[3560,["But I was just enjoying."]],[3564,["He was feeling that I’m working so hard."]],[3566,["I didn’t feel that way, just enjoying."]],[3571,["But this enjoyment is not possible for a person"]],[3574,["who has not become the pure love. Is that the trouble is."]],[3579,["The source of enjoyment is this power of love"]],[3586,["and it won’t fill the heart which does not have love."]],[3594,["As simple as that."]],[3596,["So when we are celebrating here today, these lights are what?"]],[3605,["They love. They are burning just to give you the joy."]],[3614,["Even flowers, even fruits, the whole nature."]],[3619,["What can the Fruits do, we eat them, we enjoy them."]],[3623,["They like it. What do the flowers? They come out"]],[3628,["for a short time, they live, we bring them here,"]],[3631,["we spread them, we enjoy them. They are happy about it."]],[3636,["They’re happy that they’re touching Mother’s feet."]],[3639,["But what they’re going to disappear tomorrow."]],[3641,["They’re going to die tomorrow. They’re not going to live long."]],[3645,["But this is the greatest moment for them."]],[3651,["They ask a flower, “What do you want?”"]],[3655,["Said, “I don’t want any kingdom, I don’t want anything"]],[3659,["but the road on which Adi Shakti is going to walk,"]],[3661,["please throw me there. That’s all. That’s all I want.”"]],[3665,["What is such enjoyment in that,"]],[3671,["that we don’t want any kingdom, we don’t want anything, nothing?"]],[3674,["What is that in there? Is the pouring of this love into you."]],[3680,["Completely filling you up."]],[3683,["That it is so evident you can see it,"]],[3689,["living example before you. That’s how I’ve lived all My life."]],[3696,["I don’t feel sleepy."]],[3698,["You’ve never seen Me sleeping in any program, have I?"]],[3702,["But I can see many even now sleeping."]],[3704,["I mean you have to wake them up. I can’t understand."]],[3711,["Because their hearts are not open."]],[3717,["If they open their heart, they can’t sleep,"]],[3720,["even if they want to. They’re sitting before Me,"]],[3726,["why should they close their eyes after all?"]],[3730,["Is the most surprising thing"]],[3732,["that they’ll go and touch the feet of My photograph"]],[3735,["and before Me they will sleep."]],[3741,["It’s absurd!"]],[3744,["So you must know, all of you have got that depth."]],[3748,["All have that beauty within you"]],[3750,["but you should be intelligent enough to see this point"]],[3754,["that, have we touched that point? Are we lost in that point?"]],[3761,["Now you introspect."]],[3762,["What I’m saying don’t think of others, think of yourself."]],[3765,["Have we got that?"]],[3769,["On this day of Diwali looking at these beautiful lights"]],[3773,["which will disappear,"]],[3776,["even a moment of that think that they are, they’re so happy."]],[3781,["So have we touched our, that beautiful thing"]],[3786,["which is eternal within us? Have we touched it?"]],[3791,["You ask anyone, “Do you meditate?”"]],[3796,["You eat your food, all right."]],[3798,["I asked you about meditation, why is it so?"]],[3807,["Do you look after yourself?"]],[3813,["What are you looking at, wasting our lives?"]],[3818,["Every moment is so precious, every day is so precious,"]],[3823,["every year so precious."]],[3825,["Sahaja Yoga is progressing very fast and you people have to decide"]],[3831,["that now your Mahalakshmi tattwa has to give its fruits."]],[3837,["Let’s see. I was happy to see you so happy, joyous."]],[3843,["I wish you could give this joy to each other."]],[3846,["That gives Me the greatest pleasure."]],[3851,["Of course now there aren’t much fights and nothing’s going on but"]],[3854,["there are small, small things where I find"]],[3857,["people have funny feelings about each other."]],[3864,["So forget about it. You are Sahaja yogis."]],[3866,["After all, what is going to happen?"]],[3869,["Everybody has to die in any case."]],[3872,["But at least you led a life of spirituality, of eternity."]],[3879,["See, look at them. They all know they have to die but,"]],[3882,["“Let’s burn as much as we can.”"]],[3888,["We have the light. Everybody doesn’t have the light. “Let’s burn.”"]],[3896,["This is to be understood and then you’ll enjoy."]],[3900,["Even the shortest life which is like a shooting star"]],[3905,["is worth something than a boring life of a dead person."]],[3920,["The child is crying tell her to take away the child."]],[3930,["So for this, the protocol has to be understood."]],[3940,["It’s very important to understand protocol"]],[3943,["and the protocol is this, that you are not to question Me."]],[3951,["You are not to question Me, you are not to doubt Me."]],[3956,["This is very important if you have to keep your Sahastrara open."]],[3962,["If you have any doubts, then know that you are not yet there."]],[3967,["Please keep your Sahastrara open."]],[3970,["Without your Sahastrara being open you cannot do anything."]],[3976,["Surrender means nothing but keep your Sahastrara open."]],[3980,["This is the way you are going to grow."]],[3984,["What are you going to surrender to Me?"]],[3987,["I can create the whole world like I create worlds after worlds."]],[3991,["What are you going to give Me? But just surrender."]],[3999,["You have to give nothing to Mother,"]],[4001,["you have to be one with Her,"]],[4004,["you have to be lost in Her,"]],[4006,["is to enjoy Her, to know Her."]],[4011,["That is the day"]],[4013,["when there will be a perfect Diwali in this whole world."]],[4016,["I’ll see My children becoming great lights"]],[4021,["of knowledge, truth, peace and joy."]],[4026,["That is the day I’m going to feel"]],[4030,["that we have done the job alright."]],[4035,["And let’s have that real Diwali."]],[4039,["And I’m sure it’s going to be very soon."]],[4042,["Why not compete with other countries in this like Russia,"]],[4047,["like Bulgaria instead of competing in nonsense."]],[4054,["Let’s compete. How many Sahaja Yogis we have got?"]],[4060,["What have we got to be given for Sahaja Yoga?"]],[4068,["All this will create such a beautiful personality of self respect"]],[4075,["because unless and until you have Self-knowledge"]],[4078,["you cannot have respect for it. But now you have Self-knowledge"]],[4081,["so the whole thing is going to change."]],[4084,["Today I wanted to speak to you more than the puja."]],[4086,["Is a short puja, is not a very big puja for Lakshmi"]],[4089,["because is already within you."]],[4092,["But in this short puja I wanted to speak to you"]],[4096,["that now you must respect the Mahalakshmi tattwa."]],[4101,["Now Mahalakshmi tattwa has got four sides."]],[4103,["Is the first is the Lakshmi tattwa which I told you is the love,"]],[4107,["to express your Lakshmi principle, to be generous."]],[4111,["Then we have got the Raja Lakshmi."]],[4115,["Raja Lakshmi principle is that you are like a king"]],[4120,["“I am the realized soul, so what! I’m like a king!”"]],[4126,["The kings don’t beg, do they?"]],[4129,["I mean if they beg then they are beggars, they are not kings."]],[4132,["Of course these days I don’t know what the kings are doing."]],[4136,["But, we are kings, we are royal. We walk like royal people."]],[4145,["I mean I see people sometimes"]],[4149,["walking in a manner that doesn’t behove a Sahaja yogi,"]],[4152,["living in a manner that doesn’t behove a Sahaja yogi."]],[4157,["We have to walk with the dignity of a king."]],[4163,["And the king is the one who gives, who doesn’t take anything."]],[4166,["Is the Raja Lakshmi principle in you, has to come,"]],[4169,["in all the ladies."]],[4172,["You see so, also ladies should not give way to fashions."]],[4178,["If you start changing your fashions"]],[4179,["that means you are not at all from the royal family."]],[4183,["I went to Japan. You’ll be surprised,"]],[4185,["they were very respectful to us, extremely respectful."]],[4188,["I couldn’t understand, you know, Me and My daughters."]],[4191,["So we asked the interpreter. I said,"]],[4193,["“Why are they so respectful to us?"]],[4195,["Everywhere we went they gave us the present and bowed to us?”"]],[4198,["He said, “Because they think You are from royal family.”"]],[4201,["I said, “Why, why do they think we are from royal family?”"]],[4204,["“Because You comb Your hair so well"]],[4207,["and that You don’t go to any hairdresser."]],[4211,["Royal family people never go to any hairdresser get their heads to."]],[4215,["Because Your hair are so well done."]],[4217,["That’s why they think You must be from the royal family.”"]],[4221,["Can you imagine? While we are like bhoots,"]],[4223,["how can we be Sahaja yogis?"]],[4227,["Tomorrow you have to wear the crowns."]],[4230,["We should not have dresses like beggars."]],[4232,["Do you think so that’s the sign of a royal family person?"]],[4237,["You must dress up well, neat, clean, not like a sanyasi,"]],[4243,["colorful, beautiful but with dignity."]],[4252,["It should not be a fashion."]],[4254,["Fashion is taken by ordinary people, by vulgar [people]."]],[4261,["King doesn’t take the fashion, does he?"]],[4266,["He creates the fashion. He doesn’t take fashions."]],[4271,["So you play into the hands of the fashions, this…"]],[4274,["Recently I heard the fashion is"]],[4276,["for women is to have their hair here."]],[4278,["Why? Closing the Agnya like that?"]],[4287,["If you are playing into the hands of these modern entrepreneurs"]],[4291,["and modern ideas and all those things,"]],[4293,["then know that you have no a personality of a Sahaja yogi."]],[4296,["A Sahaja yogi has his own personality."]],[4300,["He doesn’t change according to somebody says, “All right,"]],[4303,["everybody is like this, so you should be like that.”"]],[4306,["He has his own style and he has own ways of dressing up."]],[4312,["In everyday life also a royal person is such,"]],[4317,["the whole dignity of a royal person."]],[4320,["You don’t take money from others."]],[4322,["You don’t borrow money from others."]],[4324,["Do you think the king, the day he starts borrowing money,"]],[4327,["he’ll no more be a king."]],[4333,["Then a royal person always talks with a dignity"]],[4337,["as well as respect of the dignity of others."]],[4340,["He doesn’t use cheap words, slangs. Royal language he uses."]],[4356,["Now these slangs I do not know,"]],[4361,["I do not know much about them"]],[4364,["but is very much in the fashion that you go on in a slangy way."]],[4371,["You ask somebody some questions “eaah! eaah!”"]],[4378,["Is this the way a king would speak?"]],[4385,["I tell you in every behavior,"]],[4389,["if you know that you are the king and you are the queen,"]],[4392,["the whole personality will change."]],[4397,["But a beggar, if you bring the beggar and put him on the chair of a king,"]],[4401,["still he is, anybody coming, “Please give me something.”"]],[4407,["Wearing the crown he says “Oh, Please get me..”"]],[4413,["Now you are sitting on the thrones."]],[4418,["In Sanskrit word is, in Hindi they say, virargj, virargji."]],[4425,["Let this kingdom show through your behavior."]],[4429,["The kingdom of God, show in your behavior."]],[4436,["If you are a miserable creature, a TB patient,"]],[4440,["how can you be of the royal family?"]],[4447,["If you are a lanky-panky person how can you wear your swords?"]],[4453,["The other day they gave Me one sword to hold."]],[4456,["I tell you many of you cannot hold it, it’s so heavy."]],[4460,["But in My Royal Spirit, I can."]],[4466,["Same with the ladies"]],[4467,["if they have to wear the dresses of a royal family."]],[4472,["Even to wear the crown you have to have a head that is capable."]],[4481,["So that royal nature has to come in your own behavior,"]],[4484,["when you talk to others and anyone."]],[4489,["Like royal people never ask questions, never."]],[4494,["“Hmm,” they will say. “Hmm.”"]],[4499,["But a beggar will ask a question."]],[4501,["We call him a sawali, the one who ask a question all the time."]],[4508,["But why should a king ask when he knows all the answers."]],[4510,["Why should he ask for any questions?"]],[4516,["I know some people who are such headaches."]],[4518,["Now say I’m in the road. “Will You take white water or blue water?”"]],[4524,["“Baba, I take water whether blue, white anything and that’s all.”"]],[4529,["Then they’ll say, “Will You take a white comb or a red comb?”"]],[4531,["“Arey bhai, give anything.”"]],[4535,["By their asking only you get fed up that “I don’t want anything."]],[4538,["Now get out of the road, please.”"]],[4542,["Then another style is, “I have a problema, a problema.”"]],[4547,["Nothing problem, problema. “What is the problema?”"]],[4552,["“I don’t know how to carry on with my job.”"]],[4556,["Problema. Because you are a problem, that must be this problema."]],[4561,["But Mother doesn’t say, it’s all right."]],[4563,["She will suggest one thing. “But in this, this”,"]],[4566,["then She suggests another solution. “But in this, this”,"]],[4570,["then suggests three solutions."]],[4571,["She will go on suggesting ten solutions."]],[4574,["Still you will forget it’s your problem,"]],[4577,["you think it’s Mother’s problem you are discussing."]],[4582,["This is not the way the king is. The king gives solutions,"]],[4585,["he doesn’t ask for solutions."]],[4588,["Otherwise should he be king?"]],[4594,["And once you decide, “I am the king and I am going to solve my problems,”"]],[4599,["the problems should be solved like this."]],[4602,["Do I tell you My problems any time?"]],[4604,["I never use this word also – problem. This is a modern word."]],[4608,["‘Problem’ we used to only use in mathematics,"]],[4611,["I think in geometry so far, really!"]],[4618,["We didn’t know that it was used in general life."]],[4622,["So if you are the king you solve your problem."]],[4626,["If you solve your problem, then you are a king."]],[4628,["If you cannot solve your problem then you are a beggar."]],[4636,["Then cheap things."]],[4639,["To use cheap material, cheap things, cheap language,"]],[4643,["everything cheapish, is not a sign of a king."]],[4653,["I would buy one sari in the whole year but a good quality sari."]],[4658,["And I’ve got saris since My marriage, even before My marriage."]],[4661,["All those saris are with Me because I would buy only one sari"]],[4665,["of a good quality once a year, finished!"]],[4670,["And traditional, not cheapish. But people will have twenty saris"]],[4675,["and they didn’t know what to wear."]],[4677,["They’ll still walk out saying,"]],[4679,["“I have a problema, I have no sari.”"]],[4681,["Because all saris are very cheapish you have bought."]],[4685,["Same with men. Same with men. They try to save money,"]],[4689,["penny-wise pound foolishness."]],[4692,["And if you ask them. “Mother, You know what happened,"]],[4696,["I have no clothes.”"]],[4697,["“All right you come without clothes, then what to do?”"]],[4700,["“No but there is this.”"]],[4701,["“All right, then do one thing.”"]],[4704,["It is impossible to tell them that this is stupid."]],[4715,["You are the king, the way you talk to each other."]],[4720,["A king doesn’t talk too much, doesn’t."]],[4724,["If you are too talkative then remember you are not a king."]],[4728,["The king doesn’t talk too much, very little, ‘yes’ or ‘no’."]],[4734,["Or whenever he has to talk, he talks sense."]],[4738,["Also he is not glum. Another extreme are glum people."]],[4746,["You don’t know how you stand with them."]],[4750,["So one has to know that you are in charge of yourself as a king"]],[4755,["or a queen and you carry yourself with that dignity."]],[4759,["You do not shout. You do not say things slowly,"]],[4764,["as if you neck is chocked."]],[4767,["Some Sahaja yogis talk like that."]],[4770,["They think it’s very, they are kind to Me."]],[4774,["No, in freedom, but not shouting at Me and in a dignified manner."]],[4789,["Dignity is something cannot be taught."]],[4793,["It has to be inside yourself."]],[4798,["A person is not self conscious but is conscious of his dignity."]],[4808,["He doesn’t do cheap things, never."]],[4811,["Never the cheap things, you know."]],[4815,["Once a gentleman met My husband."]],[4817,["He said, “Why don’t you come and dance?”"]],[4819,["He said, “No, I don’t dance because My wife doesn’t dance.”"]],[4822,["He said, “Bring Her to England, She will start dancing.”"]],[4824,["He said, “You take Her to Moon also She won’t do.”"]],[4827,["That’s what My husband told."]],[4829,["“She’s not going to dance with this kind of a ball room dancing."]],[4833,["That She will not dance.”"]],[4840,["It’s for the men and women to understand,"]],[4844,["that is not dignified."]],[4846,["On this point you should decide,"]],[4849,["“If this is not dignified we are not going to do it."]],[4851,["We are from the royal family of Shalivahanas"]],[4858,["and we are not going to do anything that is undignified.”"]],[4865,["All the ladies, all the men, all the Sahaja yoginis"]],[4871,["and the Sahaja yogis are very different from all others."]],[4874,["And this is what we have to understand,"]],[4878,["that how dignified we are for a Raja Lakshmi."]],[4883,["Then the Gruha Lakshmi I’ve already told you."]],[4887,["And the Lakshmi tattwa I’ve already told you."]],[4890,["But there is another principle which is called alakshmi"]],[4894,["and that alakshmi principle is where you may have everything,"]],[4901,["but you are a beggar, alakshmi."]],[4911,["And that is what is to be avoided."]],[4916,["Alakshmi, without any Lakshmi principle."]],[4921,["Then there is kulakshmi."]],[4924,["Kulakshmi is when you use your money for wrong things."]],[4928,["You use your money for drugs, for this, that, for bad business."]],[4936,["Whatever business you do you should know what you are doing,"]],[4939,["is for what. Kulakshmi."]],[4945,["Grabbing the money of Sahaja yogis or Sahaja Yoga"]],[4948,["is the worst type of a Lakshmi, it’s very, very serious."]],[4955,["So that’s how you come down."]],[4959,["And, now when you see the whole world is, how it is,"]],[4964,["when you have to pull it out, you have to have more strength,"]],[4967,["more strength to pull them out, strength of love."]],[4971,["Again we come to the same point: strength of love."]],[4979,["That’s the strength keeps Me laughing all the time,"]],[4982,["enjoying Myself."]],[4985,["Even a least [part] of this joy I cannot give up."]],[4999,["In the same way I bless you"]],[5002,["with all the Lakshmi principle and Mahalakshmi principle"]],[5005,["but above all the principle of love,"]],[5008,["the pure love without any expectations, nirvajya."]],[5013,["I bless you all on this auspicious day."]],[5016,["May God bless you!Have wisdom"]],[5020,["and understand that Mother has said it out of Her heart,"]],[5022,["out of Her love, out of Her feelings for us."]],[5027,["May God bless you!"]]]);
